# Description

This PR includes:

1. a new method on the Call object to pass inbound calls to another consumer: `await call.pass()`
2. add support for `from_name` when dialing SIP device

## Type of change

- [ ] Internal refactoring
- [ ] Bug fix (bugfix - non-breaking)
- [x] New feature (non-breaking change which adds functionality)
- [ ] Breaking change (fix or feature that would cause existing functionality to not work as expected)

## Code snippets

> Pass the inbound call

```ts
import { RelayConsumer } from '@signalwire/node'

const consumer = new RelayConsumer({
  project: process.env.PROJECT,
  token: process.env.TOKEN,
  contexts: ['home', 'office'],
  onIncomingCall: async (call) => {
    console.log('Inbound call', call.id, call.from, call.to)

    // Pass call to another consumer 
    const passResult = await call.pass()
    if (!passResult.successful) {
      console.error('Error passing the call')
      return
    }
    
    console.log('Call passed to another consumer!')
  }
})

consumer.run()
```

--- 

> Set `from_name` in SIP 

```ts
import { RelayConsumer } from '@signalwire/node'

const consumer = new RelayConsumer({
  project: process.env.PROJECT,
  token: process.env.TOKEN,
  contexts: ['home', 'office'],
  ready: async ({ client }) => {
    const { successful: dialed, call } = await client.calling.dial({
      type: "sip",
      from: "sip:user-2@example.com",
      from_name: "Foo Bar",
      to: "sip:user-2@example.com",
    });
    if (!dialed) {
      console.error('Outbound call failed or not answered.')
      return
    }

    // Do something with the call..

    await call.hangup()
  }
})

consumer.run()
```

When inventory handle an asset for the first time (creation)

when GLPI ```cleanLockedsOnAdd```

if a global lock on ```entities_id``` exist for this ```itemtype```, this ```key``` ```entities_id``` is unset from ```$this->input``` 



and trigger a PHP warning during unicity check

